<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2011/08/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata minClientVersion="2.12">
    <id>MimeKit.Cryptography</id>
    <version>5.0.0</version>
    <title>MimeKit.Cryptography</title>
    <authors>Jeffrey Stedfast</authors>
    <owners>Jeffrey Stedfast</owners>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <projectUrl>https://www.mimekit.net</projectUrl>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/jstedfast/MimeKit" />
    <icon>icons\mimekit-50.png</icon>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>
      MimeKit is an Open Source library for creating and parsing MIME, S/MIME and PGP messages on desktop and mobile platforms.

      MimeKit.Cryptography extends MimeKit.Core with support for OpenPGP, S/MIME and DKIM/ARC using BouncyCastle.Cryptography. Reference this package (or the MimeKit meta-package) when you need cryptography features.

      API documentation can be found on the web at http://www.mimekit.net/docs

      For those that need SMTP, POP3 or IMAP support, check out https://github.com/jstedfast/MailKit
    </description>
    <summary>Adds OpenPGP, S/MIME and DKIM/ARC cryptography support to MimeKit.Core.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>
* Split MimeKit into MimeKit.Core and MimeKit.Cryptography (this package). The cryptography APIs are now provided as extension methods and the PgpMime/SecureMime static classes.
    </releaseNotes>
    <copyright>.NET Foundation and Contributors</copyright>
    <language>en-US</language>
    <tags>mime encryption arc dkim security smime s/mime openpgp pgp mail email tnef</tags>
